Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第22集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们认为可能是始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it may have been an Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么始祖  -每个怪物总有一个祖先\N{\fnArial\fs30}- An Alpha, like...? - Like all monsters come from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓一个活的始祖给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bag me a live Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是吸血鬼的祖先  -始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The first of your species. - The very first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处理下那一屋子始祖吧  既不能丢下不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prison full of monsters -- can't just leave them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也不能放了它们  -我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- can't let them go. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兴隆地产是罗曼公司一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geothrive is part of Roman Enterprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.87,0:00:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克又要资助一个考古挖掘项目...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick's funding an archaeological dig...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:20.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在沙特阿拉伯的工厂...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Factory in saudi arabia...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和雅加达的渔场...\N{\fnArial\fs30}fishery in jakarta...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-科研中心  -遍地都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A research center. - - It's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是一条绳上的蚂蚱  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all tied together, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.15,0:00:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨魂就是这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was vengeful-spirit crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:31.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他还是鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's still Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:34.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是凯文·谭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a... K-Kevin Tran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在读大学预修课\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in advanced placement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是神之语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the word of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中之一  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那到底写的是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what's it say, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面写着关于利维坦的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about Leviathan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有写怎么杀死他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it say anything about how to kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若要杀死利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leviathan cannot be slain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能用正直凡人之骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}but by a bone of a righteous mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浸以三种堕落者之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}washed in the three bloods of the fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:55.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说我们先要找到堕落天使的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says we need to start with the blood of a fallen angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:00:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我总是愿意为温家兄弟流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always happy to bleed for the winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:08.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格洛丽亚·简  为您带来《商业观察》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Business watch with our own, Gloria Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.62,0:01:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  菲尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们把话题转向农业\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we turn our attention to agriculture,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.11,0:01:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位意想不到的嘉宾\N{\fnArial\fs30}where an unlikely personality
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在已高调来到了直播现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}has now come on to the scene in a major way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德·罗曼  执行总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard roman, a C.E.O.,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.29,0:01:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的公司在国防和航空工业占据主导地位\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose company ominates the defense and aviation sectors,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不用说他还是励志演说家中的翘楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to mention being a giant in the motivational-speaking world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.59,0:01:26.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法  格洛丽亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say, Gloria?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.09,0:01:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个多面手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a multitasker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.09,0:01:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.31,0:01:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最近又通过收购控股了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you've recently purchased controlling stock
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏克农业公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Sucrocorp --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.46,0:01:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是家处于世界领先地位的\N{\fnArial\fs30}among the world's leading manufacturers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高果糖玉米糖浆制造公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}in high-fructose corn syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理查德  很荣幸你能接受我们的采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure to have you with us, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请叫我"迪克"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. "Dick."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  迪克  跟我们说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell us, Dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么最近你开始对粮食产业感兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}why the recent fascination with big foods?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.82,0:01:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人人都知道  我们都爱吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's no secret we all love to eat,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过苏克农业公司关注的是吃得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now Sucrocorp will focus on eating well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请说说两者的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me connect the dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.50,0:01:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摄入甜味剂怎么让我们变得更健康的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will pumping sweeteners into our system make us healthier?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个字  纯\N{\fnArial\fs30}One word -- purity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们少放食品添加剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dialing back the additives
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.54,0:01:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向全美消费者提供高质产品\N{\fnArial\fs30}to deliver the highest quality all-American product
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.12,0:02:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对得起民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}you people deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国是进取人士的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}America is for go-getters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲力亲为  就能创造奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}folks who get off their butts and make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们力求让您获得健康的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need you just as healthy as you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we are diving whole hog
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.63,0:02:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让美国人更长寿...\N{\fnArial\fs30}into what keeps Americans living longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也更美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tasting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do, of course, mean to say
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.61,0:02:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物会变得更美味吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}the food will be tasting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.56,0:02:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.73,0:02:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你十一点约的人已经在会议室候着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your 11:00 a.m. is waiting in the conference room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:41.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还在找主流媒体的代言人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we still looking for a rep in mainstream media?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.81,0:02:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是的  -太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, we are. - Wunderbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.85,0:02:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去把格洛丽亚"换"下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a "replace order" on Gloria there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.35,0:03:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尸体怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with the corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.71,0:03:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打给厨师菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call chef Fieri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想吃烧烤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  我是迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin. Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你真让我激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very excited to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:25.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很紧张吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.21,0:03:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.55,0:03:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是你的超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your biggest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:32.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你带了份礼物过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说什么  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that say, Kev?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,悠着点  埃德加  别吓坏了这男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, Edgar. Don't scare the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查过你的背景  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've checked, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是班上的第一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number one in your class,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切特·肯尼迪优秀青年科学家称号获得者\N{\fnArial\fs30}winner of the Chad Kennedy Top Young Scientist prize --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是个神之语的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}all that on top of being keeper of the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个聪明的年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a clever young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你会做出正确的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm confident you'll make the right choice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我明白这是谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I see this is a negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我会加大...筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I will sweeten... the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的线人告诉我说你在申请普林斯顿大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sources tell me you're applying to Princeton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我这样的人物给你写封推荐信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Letter of recommendation like that from a man like me --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保你入校\N{\fnArial\fs30}done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  我很欣赏你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your gumption, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是觉得有商量的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}But i still think there's some wiggle room here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you what --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们加大筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kick it up a notch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我能不能改变你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if I can't change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加  直播信号弄好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar, that live feed up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.48,0:05:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:13.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想谈判有结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think this negotiation is concluded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  你真会讨价还价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drive a hard bargain, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.55,0:05:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  我读这个的次数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, man, I have read this more times
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都超过在爸爸包里发现的那本《花花公子》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}than the Playboy I found in dad's duffel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是安娜·尼科尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna Nicole?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是安娜·尼科尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna Nicole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.53,0:05:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好东西就是没的快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the good -- they die young, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.73,0:05:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看这个看到双目流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can read this till our eyes bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也看不出更多眉目\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't getting any clearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then what does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斩其首  躯体挣扎凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut off the head, and the body will flounder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:57.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对  -好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:06:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们都同意迪克就是首领  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we both agree that the head is Dick. right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:01.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  总之  我们去找材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, bottom line is, we go grab the stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.53,0:06:05.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做成武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we mix ourselves a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全赞同把迪克干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm all for killing Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  那剩下的利维坦怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what about the rest of the Leviathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:13.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会...死掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are they gonna just...drop dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在觉得"也许"就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Maybe" is good enough for you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.97,0:06:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一个一个来  行吗  -行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One problem at a time, all right? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们横冲直撞之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not a crazy idea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先探明有没有什么阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}to try and figure out what the catch is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不算是很疯狂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we go crashing the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.89,0:06:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许这就是那个阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this is the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:26.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝不把什么都告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's not telling us every detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.68,0:06:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是神之语啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word is from god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.11,0:06:32.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还指望什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how much better it's gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前所未有的强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个瞎忙活这会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, while you two have been chasing your tails,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:03.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都在考虑武器的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been thinking on that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你不觉得你应该省省力气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Don't you think you should be savings your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.09,0:07:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,省来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得你该缓缓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying you might want to slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't look so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犀利的日子一去不复返了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Brad Pitt days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子说杀死利维坦唯一的方法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the kid says that the only way to kill Leviathan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.21,0:07:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用淋过三种堕落之血的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}is with a bone washed in the three bloods of the fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人的骨头  利维坦有多饥饿和黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be from a human as light and good
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人就要有多光明和善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the Leviathan are hungry and dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那个好找啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的能找  现在就能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest is doable, and doable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经拿到了堕落天使的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already got the fallen angel blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是堕落人类统治者的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, next up is blood from the ruler of fallen humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说的话  就是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the best I can tell, that's Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三是堕落野兽之父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numero tres is the father of fallen beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.03,0:07:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取一个始祖的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to bleed an Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.32,0:07:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们帮克劳力找到的  都赶到了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, every one we found, we rounded up for Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后小卡把他们全干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then Cass whammied them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那行  就让小卡去解决吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, make this Cass' problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡现在没有解决问题的能力  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass ain't exactly in the problem-solving mode, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就找克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.25,0:08:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你们俩可以搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have faith that you boys will figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:12.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:15.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是有点激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got a little carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.71,0:08:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏克农业公司的宗旨是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here at Sucrocorp,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顾客的安康至上\N{\fnArial\fs30}your well-being is our number-one priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.93,0:08:30.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏克农业公司  吃好  生活才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucrocorp: eat well, live well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.48,0:08:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little F.Y.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比现在在厕所驻扎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's officing out of the john these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺尴尬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他对于那武器有点想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does have some ideas about the weapon, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.53,0:08:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准还真是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, he may be just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"罗曼购得..."  苏克农业公司是干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Roman acquires..." what's Sucrocorp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.48,0:08:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们生产食品添加剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They make food additives,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是高果糖玉米糖浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}namely high-fructose corn syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那东西掺在...几乎什么里面都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}That crap is in -- well, it's in just about everything --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.29,0:09:01.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏打  调味酱  面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}um, soda, sauces, bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馅饼不会有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say "pie."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,馅饼绝对有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.65,0:09:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼不玩餐馆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman's moved past restaurants?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.26,0:09:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改玩食品商店  便利店  自动售货机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into grocery stores, Gas n' Sips, vending machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can we do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.52,0:09:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了对他们的卡车和工厂发动恐怖袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short of going al qaeda on their trucks and plants,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:24.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先前说了  鲍比有点想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, uh, Bobby's got some ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.87,0:09:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.41,0:09:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两位好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:44.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你写的是一篇振奋人心的美文啊  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some bracing prose you're putting down there, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好  普林斯顿大学有你真是幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done well. Princeton will be lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.23,0:09:58.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强调乱说话的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But stress the consequences of talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  我要你稍稍再陪我一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, I'm gonna request the pleasure of your company a tad longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.24,0:10:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去拜访一位老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to drop in on an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来那些乱七八糟的符文就是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's what all the "rumble, rumble" was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:22.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁翻译出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who translated it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.85,0:10:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少管  你愿不愿意给我们血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. You gonna give us the blood or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但目前不乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想剁了迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all for chopping Dick,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:34.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我不能让你们带着一瓶我的血到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't have you running around with a vial of my blood, now, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我的敌人拿到了那些血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the sheer number of nefarious spells
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以施多少邪恶的法术吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}my enemies can use that blood for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那要什么时候  -到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then when? - Last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:46.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你们找齐了其他东西后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After you've got all the other components.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我估摸着  天使那边是最难搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most difficult, the angel part, I'm assuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到你们在他们天启里的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given your role in their little Apocalypse,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我难以想象  上头那些唱诗班的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine the choirboys upstairs
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会为你们献血  给你们...怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}are wetting their vestments to do you -- what's the word? --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}a solid...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  除非你手里有天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, of course, you have an angel up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.64,0:11:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是挺方便的  不过没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that'd be convenient, but, uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们总有办法拿到天使的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get the angel blood one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.71,0:11:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们下次再找你时你得准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just need you to be ready next time we call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提示你们一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here's a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:19.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有可靠的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have it on good authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.81,0:11:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个始祖活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one Alpha still among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消息来源是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.59,0:11:26.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个吸血鬼始祖够狡猾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wily character, that Alpha vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在小卡摧毁了那地方之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow made good his prison break
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就不知怎的跑了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before cass went nuclear on the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.65,0:11:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know this how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲近你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your friends close,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.44,0:11:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更要怎么着你的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}your enemies, blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.00,0:11:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用说了  我招子亮着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Needless to say, I keep tabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他行踪不定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He moves around quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have an inkling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道从哪儿开始寻找复活节彩蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where to start the easter-egg hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝追踪快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy trails.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.79,0:11:53.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个混蛋  他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Where, jackass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:02.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北达科他州  虎帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hoople, North Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写张纸条不就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece of paper would have worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.92,0:12:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seem angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.94,0:12:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生气  他当然生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angry? of course he's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换作你是鲍比  你不生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were Bobby, wouldn't you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他有没有显得疲惫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But was he showing signs of fatigue,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是看着不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}like -- like fritzing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.97,0:12:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  其实正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, it was just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说感觉到前所未有的强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he never felt stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是担心这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I was afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:49.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他越是强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stronger he gets,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.37,0:12:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就越是有可能完全变成怨魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}the closer he comes to going full vengeful spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要商量一下怎么对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk about what we're going to do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对付他  -是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do with him? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.93,0:12:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个星期前  你还在说要跟他共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three weeks ago, you were talking how this could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就想让他安乐死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you want to go Kevorkian on his ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.87,0:13:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟传说中还没有与人为善的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying that the lore doesn't have a single real-life example
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幽灵的先例\N{\fnArial\fs30}of casper the friendly ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基本都是恶作剧鬼  直到猎人过来...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all basically poltergeists until a hunter comes along...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说是个屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the lore sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是纯怨念啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking pure hatred, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.11,0:13:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}No humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  他可能杀人  附体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he could...kill...possess people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比可以把这栋楼都烧个精光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, Bobby could burn this friggin' building down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:21.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他做了出格的事...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if he goes off the rails
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看那边的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out that guy over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.86,0:13:27.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉不觉得他有点恍惚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seem a little out of it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边的美食大妈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Paula Deen over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他们看起来好像...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they -- they look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像吃火鸭鸡三明治的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}...like those turducken people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是玉米糖浆的作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the corn syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店里所有的东西都加了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in the store is laced with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.93,0:14:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都要中毒性休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, I'm gonna go into toxic shock, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要路上吃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I...I need my road food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就正中罗曼的下怀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Roman is banking on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这上面写着"天然"  那就没问题了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one says "natural." t-that means it's safe. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想打击你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to break it to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过玉米糖浆说白了也是天然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but corn syrup is natural, technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我们到底吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what the hell are we supposed to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.25,0:14:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太黑了  看不到里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's totally dark. I can't see inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:46.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是等到天亮再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, should we wait for daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行  我们不能等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no, we're not waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:49.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll scout it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看有没有必要带重武器进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we need to bring in the big guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不好吧  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Look, Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.35,0:15:09.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有些值得一瞧的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's something you're gonna want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.46,0:15:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:50.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电池酸液也能杀吸血鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know a way to kill vamps with battery acid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道砍头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only way I know is beheading.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.51,0:15:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有什么东西能杀掉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, something didn't agree with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.93,0:16:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看那面墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看是不是有些蹊跷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something seem weird to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:12.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能不能找到开关或者操控杆之类的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, see if you can find a switch or a lever or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  把刀收了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Machete.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. we're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.23,0:16:52.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看  没尖牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? No fangs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我八岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈把我留在游戏场  去商店买东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom left me at the playground while she ran to the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.58,0:17:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个男人走过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man approached me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说我是那儿最可爱的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and said I was the prettiest girl there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我就和...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been living with these...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.77,0:17:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西住在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}things...ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道为什么抓你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是他的"珍馐"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm one of his special girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人负责看好我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the others, it was their job
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时刻准备着迎接始祖的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure I was ready for the Alpha, whenever he came.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.07,0:17:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我洗干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wash me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天给我打营养液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me my IV bags every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.03,0:17:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只摄入那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my only food.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我的血才纯净\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my blood's pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们这样对你多久了  十二年吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been doing this for, what, 12 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处女最美味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Virgins are a delicacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他身边总有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always has at least one of us on hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把你送回你妈妈身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you back to your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认为她还会记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think she remembers me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她当然记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course she does.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.35,0:17:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不记得她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you remember her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}These, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人  他们是你朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys -- they, uh, friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:08.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,始祖来的时候他们负责照顾他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They take care of the Alpha when he's here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一周前  他们出去捕猎回来  说这次很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week ago, they came back from what they said was an easy hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到了三个人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three humans just came,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.27,0:18:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都没怎么反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}didn't put up any fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当吸血鬼开始进食时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when they started on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都痛苦地尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}the vampires screamed in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那几个吸过血的立即就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones who ate died immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.96,0:18:27.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些没吸的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the ones who didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:29.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:31.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当他看到这种情况时  他就只吸动物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he saw what happened, he moved to animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这会就出去捕猎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out hunting as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从没听说吸血鬼对人类过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of vamps being allergic to humans before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说会不会是玉米糖浆引起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe it's the corn syrup?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油站的那些人都像吸了毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gas n' sip was lousy with stoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任人宰割\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ripe for the picking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.40,0:18:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她倒是说那次捕猎很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did say it was an easy hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道现在始祖在什么地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where the alpha is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不好  可能知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当情况不妙时  他会去一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has a place he goes when something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说那是他的别苑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He calls it his retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:00.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是萨姆的混蛋跟踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's, uh, that's Sam's douche tracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我们找到始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helps us find the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need's an address.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.25,0:19:12.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我记得一些事可能能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I remember things that maybe can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.71,0:19:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你就尽力而为吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. Just do the best you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.06,0:19:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.05,0:19:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杂志都翻完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd run out of magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问个问题  你老大在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick question. Where's your boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再问一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他在哪  -下地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.15,0:20:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  我住的地方比那儿差远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. My neighborhood is worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒙大纳州米苏拉市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missoula, Montana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.32,0:20:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这么难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that so hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.65,0:20:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我熬不住了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能像个兔子似的活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't live on rabbit food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm -- I'm a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.02,0:20:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可说不定啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:25.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一步该干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's next on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.84,0:20:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们要突袭一个始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if we're bum-rushing the Alpha,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就得弄些死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we're gonna need dead man's blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:30.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就得去停尸房\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means a morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:39.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管停尸房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, forget the morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在到处都是吸血鬼毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are swimming in vamp poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.73,0:20:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰下  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...我们是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh, we're with the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红十字会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在血库突然紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we have an emergency shortage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.53,0:20:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要您...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna need you to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你完全听不懂我在说什么是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting a word I'm saying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胳膊举起来  我们要抽点血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold out your arm. We need your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.81,0:21:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽情抽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tap the keg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  萨姆  瞧瞧四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Sam, look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.77,0:21:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就像伍德斯托克音乐节\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's friggin' Woodstock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.79,0:21:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人都嗑了棕色酸液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's hopped up on the brown acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不用说废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need the song and dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直接扎他就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a little prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好疼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说这是为了卡特里娜飓风灾区吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for Hurricane Katrina, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.46,0:21:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们到了那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we get there...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.17,0:21:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.51,0:21:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比不能跟着来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby's gonna have to hang back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.18,0:22:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不同意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you disagree?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.25,0:22:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定不答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't gonna like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.37,0:22:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他帮我们找到了爱米莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he helped us in getting Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也挺鲍比的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm team Bobby, too. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们把他和爱米莉留在车里是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a reason we left him in the car with Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.39,0:22:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂的  他越参与行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.The more action he sees,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:10.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就越容易发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more chance he gets to spin out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.61,0:22:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.86,0:22:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不让他上前线\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we'll keep him off the front lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就能保持冷静  继续这样  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he can just, you know, keep calm and carry on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他做不到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:39.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们带你去吸血鬼大本营时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they hauled you off to vamp camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:41.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得开了多久的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you remember how long the drive was?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:43.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们晚上出发的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We left at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在日出前到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got in before dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:48.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么是六七个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, six, seven hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.35,0:22:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.65,0:22:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得上过高速吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember any highways?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我们只走小路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We only took back roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那就算他们每小时四十五英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, figure they averaged 45 miles per --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.14,0:22:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不会超过三百英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't have been more than 300 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.81,0:22:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.91,0:23:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们走的那个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}What direction were you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.14,0:23:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得了  很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  爱米  你做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's okay. Em, you're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...is there anything else you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.75,0:23:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钟声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们停车时  我听到很响的钟声\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we pulled up, I heard these loud bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.29,0:23:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当时还没天亮吗  -是教堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was still dark out? - You thinking church?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.43,0:23:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教堂不那么早敲钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能是个修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have been a monastery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.43,0:23:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教士早上四点就起来祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monks get up at 4:00 a.m. to pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.27,0:23:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不能泡妞  又不能睡懒觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. Can't get laid. Can't sleep in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friggin' tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.39,0:23:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么始祖的大本营在花果山旁边(Monk教士和Monkey猴子发音相近)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, Alpha's camping next to a, uh, monkey house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.98,0:23:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个范围内有几座\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many do we got in range?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.61,0:23:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似只有一座\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.15,0:23:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just outside...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.97,0:23:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(欢迎来到蒙大拿州密苏拉市)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.26,0:23:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是在这带走我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where he took me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.63,0:23:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:23:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会带你去一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get you someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.05,0:24:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再绕回来灭了这些吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circle back and ginsu these leeches.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.09,0:24:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她就是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but she couldn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.51,0:24:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  这就是著名的鸢尾宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the famous Fleur-de-lis Mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.73,0:24:14.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一亿两千五百万的房产\N{\fnArial\fs30}$125 million estate...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:16.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.72,0:24:18.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,10CC吸血鬼毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 ccs of vamptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.99,0:24:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么一说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.06,0:24:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡黛珊是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a Kardashian?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.41,0:24:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.45,0:24:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}just another bloodsucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.42,0:24:32.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没  就开个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it-- it's... a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.59,0:24:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.76,0:24:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们黎明还没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're not back by dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.67,0:24:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打这个乔迪·米尔斯的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}call this number, Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.96,0:24:41.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.18,0:24:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会照顾你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.01,0:24:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  用这部手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, use this phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.68,0:24:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta hang here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.30,0:24:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为你好  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your own good. Capiche?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.92,0:24:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.02,0:24:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.64,0:24:52.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风吹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.11,0:25:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静一点  鲍比  我们很快就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chill out, Bobby. We'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.34,0:25:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他好像不太高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he didn't take that very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.50,0:25:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还指望他怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you think he was gonna take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.67,0:25:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.67,0:25:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.98,0:25:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.75,0:25:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个小骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you little schemer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.99,0:26:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我就在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.49,0:26:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你送去了一份礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sending you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.31,0:26:03.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.88,0:26:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天我向你们介绍了这位美国商界的新星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday I introduced you to this rising star in American business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.58,0:26:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我们将走进幕后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this hour, we'll go behind the scenes
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.47,0:26:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问出大家几个月来都在问的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and answer the question everyone's been asking for months --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.77,0:26:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么让迪克战无不胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}what makes Dick so hard to beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.39,0:26:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.06,0:26:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这个时间段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this time of day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.74,0:26:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们大部分都在睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}most of them would be catching z's.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.60,0:26:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们浑然不觉就被我们拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't know what hit them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在听我说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.06,0:26:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.15,0:26:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就这么冲进去砍头吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you just want to charge in there, machetes blazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.65,0:26:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一次  动用了一堆猎人才拿下始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, it took a dozen hunters to take down the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.10,0:26:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分猎人还都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And most of them didn't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you got a better idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.67,0:26:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太傻了  蠢毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid, stupid, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.31,0:27:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.97,0:27:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们来迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.88,0:27:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.92,0:27:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我的家乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, where I'm from,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.79,0:27:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得牙齿利  爪子锋  才能爬到顶峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have to bite and claw your way to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.91,0:27:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦到达巅峰  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you get there, trust me,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.25,0:27:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风景美得不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}the view's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.67,0:27:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Dean's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.21,0:27:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.60,0:27:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.16,0:27:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.18,0:27:55.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-里面没事吧  -我的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything okay in there? - My birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.12,0:27:58.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.37,0:28:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我需要你的帮助  -离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need your help. - Get away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.05,0:28:09.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听着  我得离开这  -求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, I need out of here. - Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.90,0:28:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就借用你一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need you a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.90,0:28:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到那混蛋就放了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just till I get the bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.67,0:28:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温家双煞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.75,0:28:56.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱米莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emily.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.80,0:29:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.40,0:29:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为在地下室长大的女孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a girl raised in a basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.57,0:29:08.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真会演戏啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a hell of an actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.80,0:29:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们要伤害我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna hurt my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.11,0:29:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是斯德哥尔摩症候群患者中的奇葩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a trophy in Stockholm Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.57,0:29:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想煞风景  不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to burst your bubble, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.68,0:29:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有恶意\N{\fnArial\fs30}we weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.95,0:29:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆有个更好的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam here had a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.53,0:29:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是来谈谈的  仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to talk. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.69,0:29:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我的手下拿走了你们的刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that my guys have taken your blades
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.43,0:29:33.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和装污血的注射器吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your syringes of tainted blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这个意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.04,0:29:37.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.51,0:29:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得你也许还耿耿于怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}figured you might hold a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.86,0:29:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.34,0:29:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们抓了我  折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you captured me, tortured me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.18,0:29:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我出卖给地狱之王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}sold me to the King of Hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.49,0:29:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实那是我们的外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was more our grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.69,0:30:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.16,0:30:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真给力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.82,0:30:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要扒掉你们的小白脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to peel off your faces
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-再慢慢吸干你们的血  -听我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and drink you slowly. - Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.24,0:30:07.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.98,0:30:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我饥渴着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. I am thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.32,0:30:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场瘟疫  我们知道是什么造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plague! We know what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.50,0:30:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你了解利维坦这东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about Leviathan?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:20.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,略知一二\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.82,0:30:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他们给你们的食物投毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they're poisoning the food supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.39,0:30:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去年秋天和罗曼共进晚餐时他没提及这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman didn't mention that when we met for dinner last fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.59,0:30:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们制定了很多计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made lots of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.73,0:30:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和他  关系好得很呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on excellent terms, he and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.38,0:30:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.17,0:30:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有没有提到  他会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he mention that he was going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.42,0:30:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒害全人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}maui wowie the human population?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.08,0:30:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.72,0:30:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说觅食会史无前例的方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said grabbing a snack would be easier than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.45,0:30:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你们会相亲相爱一辈子  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you'd all live together, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.38,0:30:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really believe him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.37,0:30:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你的孩子们是意外死亡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think your children are dying by accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.73,0:30:58.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,婴儿食品里都有毒药\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is pesticide in the formula!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.11,0:31:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这么想也无可厚非\N{\fnArial\fs30}It suits you to think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们需要我站在你们这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.75,0:31:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不是我们被从里面烧穿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're not the ones burning from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.59,0:31:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.39,0:31:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和你订的协议都是狗屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever deal he made with you was crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.93,0:31:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-相信我们  -你们为什么和我说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust us! - Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.47,0:31:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们能阻止迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we can stop Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.59,0:31:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止整件事  我们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop all of it. We just...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.27,0:31:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要你的血  来做武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your blood-- for the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.60,0:31:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们现在想防止\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you want to prevent
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.12,0:31:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼一族的灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}the extermination of the vampire race.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.57,0:31:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.85,0:31:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但总比和你们一起死的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it beats going down with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.17,0:31:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾伦  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allan, darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.96,0:31:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.41,0:31:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是越来越反胃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the creep gets creepier.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.92,0:31:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -埃德加来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - Edgar's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真巧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, what a funny coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.08,0:31:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要肥皂  清洁剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we need soap, uh, cleanser,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.43,0:32:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有硼砂的都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything with borax in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.57,0:32:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还要刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.82,0:32:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们关进书房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them in the study.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.34,0:32:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, no, no. No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.23,0:32:06.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  等下  -给你们个建议  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, wait. - Word of advice, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.25,0:32:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我活过了几个世纪的极冷和极热的气候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not live through centuries of fire and ice
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.25,0:32:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经历了大陆分裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and continental divide...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.03,0:32:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不是靠妄下结论做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}by jumping to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.88,0:32:16.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. 
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.27,0:32:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在犯傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.81,0:32:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.80,0:32:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先了解情况总是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never hurts to get the story first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.89,0:32:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.16,0:32:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早知道你来  就给你准备美味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've whipped you up a meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.95,0:32:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.24,0:32:51.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很想知道你为什么要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying to know why you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.11,0:32:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.70,0:32:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.50,0:32:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了温家双煞的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell Sam and Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.73,0:33:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.14,0:33:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说埃德加来这儿的目的跟我们一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Edgar's here for the same reason we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.22,0:33:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们发现我们是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, look, if they figured out
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.31,0:33:18.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿始祖的血做武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we're here to get Alpha blood for a weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.99,0:33:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为不管怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think any way you slice it,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.05,0:33:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃豆人和《真爱如血》放在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got Pac Man and True Blood in the same room,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.62,0:33:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总没好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.46,0:33:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又不笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.45,0:33:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛要把我们关在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell do you think he locked us in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.94,0:33:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们可是他的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we're his enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.35,0:33:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们这些怪物可是一家亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they're like monster cousins or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.04,0:33:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做是你  你愿意相信谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would you give the benefit of the doubt to?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.48,0:33:35.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定苏克食品毒死吸血鬼就是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know what? Maybe the Sucro is poisoning the vamps on accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.19,0:33:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能会解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they'll fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.97,0:33:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为他以地球上最古老的怪物自居\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got the oldest monster on earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.35,0:33:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认为自己战无不胜  因为他一直没遇到对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinking he can hold his own because he always has.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.92,0:33:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃德加会把他生吞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar's gonna eat him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.84,0:33:47.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.22,0:33:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能用这个撬锁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you could pick a lock with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.11,0:34:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的吸血鬼毒液都被收走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gave up all our vamptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.38,0:34:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.75,0:34:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要那俩小子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.32,0:34:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.99,0:34:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.36,0:34:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这就找人带他们出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have them sent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.69,0:34:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.75,0:34:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Edgar...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.58,0:34:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道萨姆和迪恩来这儿干嘛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know why Sam and Dean are here, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.67,0:34:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们坚称你们想把我们赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They insist that you're exterminating us,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.46,0:34:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我想  这不可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought, well, that's...impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.39,0:34:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.88,0:34:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想得没错  当然不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.53,0:35:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真是吸血鬼毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.25,0:35:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friggin' vamptonite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.59,0:35:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  咱们需要刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we need knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.59,0:35:27.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里肯定有储备室或厨房之类的  赶紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be a prep room or a kitchen somewhere. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.45,0:35:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有点不明白  埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what I don't understand, Edgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道那个小添加剂有些副作用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are aware that your little additive has side effects, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.08,0:35:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克警告过你可能会有设计缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick warned you there might be kinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.75,0:35:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  他还说会跟我联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. He also said he'd be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.36,0:35:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的孩子们都很惊恐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children are in a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.12,0:35:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们电话也不打一个  也不给个信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't call, you don't write,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.32,0:35:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不送点礼问候一下啥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't send cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.04,0:35:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们打算平息这场瘟疫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where exactly on the list is fixing our plague?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.28,0:35:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.94,0:35:58.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}...nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.59,0:36:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想让你们像小强一样烧死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want you to burn like the little roaches you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.83,0:36:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗曼说只要我不插手  自然有我的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman said if I kept quiet, I would get my reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.64,0:36:11.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你现在只能乖乖等死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you get to lay down and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.98,0:36:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是针对你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.99,0:36:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的添加剂还能杀死狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our additive kills the wolves, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.58,0:36:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变形怪  和那些吃尸体的恶心的小怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}the shifters, and those disgusting little things that eat corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.84,0:36:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要是以人类为食的统统都会毒死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything with a taste for human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只除了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:28.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说人类都是有限资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mankind's a limited resource, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有七十亿人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are seven billion... of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.60,0:36:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有七十亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.61,0:36:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们是你们的后代  -算不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We come from you. - Barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.63,0:36:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是夏娃之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the son of Eve!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.45,0:36:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是个可怜的小杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pathetic mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.59,0:36:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么资格跟我们并列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardly one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.02,0:36:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Eve,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.47,0:36:54.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你说句大实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.44,0:36:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的老娘就是个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}your mommy was a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.37,0:37:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扭来扭曲  一滴血都不能落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't squirm. I need every last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.99,0:37:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿个杯子  榨他的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a glass. We're juicing this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.44,0:37:27.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.32,0:37:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.28,0:37:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.65,0:37:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她受了不少苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been through quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.58,0:37:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.82,0:37:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你把她从秋千上绑走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming from the guy who took her off the swing-set.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.84,0:37:41.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是想跟我打一架呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to do this fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.91,0:37:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是想要我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you want my blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.60,0:38:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们帮我搞定了埃德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}For taking care of Edgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.55,0:38:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可以滚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.24,0:38:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个小男孩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.34,0:38:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.36,0:38:32.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we look like we're joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.84,0:38:36.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这儿还有多少小孩  变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many other kids you got in here, you freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.73,0:38:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会儿就他一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the moment, just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.95,0:38:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱米莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emily...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.06,0:38:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮艾伦穿好外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}help Allan with his coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.30,0:38:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要跟萨姆和迪恩一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaving with Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.53,0:38:57.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.76,0:39:10.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有搞错  连个谢谢都不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No "Thank you"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.84,0:39:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对哦对哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这会儿血脉贲张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your flesh is crawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.43,0:39:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只想宰了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you really want to do is kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.84,0:39:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一想到还得伺机再来  就气得不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hate having to wait and come back and try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.53,0:39:24.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.78,0:39:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是赶快把身体和头分开  拿得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't leave that head too close to that body for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.20,0:39:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下季再见咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you next season.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.07,0:39:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.57,0:39:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们以后可别再这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's never do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察以为是我们绑架了小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops thought we took that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.11,0:39:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要他能回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as he gets back to his folks,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.43,0:39:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管别人怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what they thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.23,0:39:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还得跳窗啊  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to jump out a freakin' window, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.85,0:40:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.89,0:40:12.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.89,0:40:13.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.91,0:40:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.51,0:40:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能测到一些电磁反应  但是消散得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting trace bits of EMF, but it's fading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.66,0:40:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比可能已经离开三四个小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bobby's probably been gone three or four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.66,0:40:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把酒瓶拿走了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got the flask, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.00,0:40:42.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在要怎么找他啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we supposed to track him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.06,0:40:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想说的  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hate to say this, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.64,0:40:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就别说了  他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then don't. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.87,0:40:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么能这会儿来这一出呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could he do this... Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.37,0:40:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们已经拿到一半的武器材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we've got half the freakin' weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.82,0:41:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-马上就要成功了  -那已经不是他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we're almost there. - It's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.91,0:41:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经不在思考了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's not thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.08,0:41:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就自顾自的  任他在外面游荡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, we just keep going while he's out there like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.31,0:41:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有别的选择吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have any other option?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.17,0:41:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要我们这么做的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's what he'd want us to do. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.03,0:41:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.99,0:41:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  他  弗兰克  还有小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, him and Frank and Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.77,0:41:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他的头脑还算清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}if his marbles were in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.10,0:41:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好在咱们还能找克劳力  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing we got Crowley in our corner. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.69,0:41:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来最后总是得靠他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing as how it all comes down to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.59,0:41:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定万无一失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.06,0:41:36.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.34,0:41:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.21,0:41:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们好好谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have so much to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
